{"title": "Daylight (area)", "pageid": 49879, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Daylight_(area)", "categories": ["Summoned areas", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Daylight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Daylight (area) controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Daylight</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a> created by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Sphere\" title=\"Daylight: Sphere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/25px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/38px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/50px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight: Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/25px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Sphere\" title=\"Daylight: Sphere\">Daylight: Sphere</a>. It creates an area of magical brightness, greatly illuminating the surrounding area and dispelling <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">Darkness</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>A sphere of powerful light, bright as the sun.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Daylight\"> Condition: Daylight </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(Condition)\" title=\"Daylight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(Condition)\" title=\"Daylight (Condition)\">Daylight</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Shining with the light of the sun. Dispels <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">Darkness</a> within a radius of 15 m (50 ft).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Enchant_Item\" title=\"Daylight: Enchant Item\">Enchant Item</a> version of this spell requires the target creature have a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapon</a> in their main hand.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Sphere\" title=\"Daylight: Sphere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/45px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/60px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight: Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Daylight_Sphere_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Sphere\" title=\"Daylight: Sphere\">Daylight: Sphere</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203343\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1317/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12779/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3702/4194304 bytes\nHighe